WEBVTT

01:40.830 --> 01:44.250
[A Moment But Forever]

01:45.080 --> 01:47.250
[Episode 4]

01:50.310 --> 01:52.030
This Essence Nourishing Pill is actually...

02:03.950 --> 02:04.750
What are you doing?

02:05.050 --> 02:05.810
I'm taking him with me.

02:05.820 --> 02:06.760
The spirit refinement is not over yet.

02:06.790 --> 02:07.670
Don't be reckless.

02:07.750 --> 02:08.229
Step aside!

02:08.259 --> 02:09.139
How dare you!

02:12.120 --> 02:12.930
Stop.

02:13.590 --> 02:14.430
High Priest.

02:19.400 --> 02:20.700
Why did you harm him?

02:22.440 --> 02:23.600
I'm asking you a question.

02:25.180 --> 02:26.110
Ji Tanyin.

02:29.270 --> 02:30.350
How are you?

02:31.230 --> 02:32.190
Let's go.

02:32.380 --> 02:33.180
But...

02:33.210 --> 02:34.010
Go.

02:55.980 --> 02:57.430
This is Liujiao Palace's

02:57.470 --> 02:58.790
new handmaiden?

02:59.350 --> 03:00.150
That's her.

03:01.990 --> 03:02.790
Grand Elder,

03:03.220 --> 03:04.400
why can't we take

03:04.400 --> 03:05.630
more divine blood at once?

03:05.630 --> 03:07.020
Doing it every few days

03:07.020 --> 03:08.030
is such a hassle.

03:09.510 --> 03:10.710
The Divine Left Hand

03:10.790 --> 03:12.910
is nourished by his essence blood.

03:13.670 --> 03:15.270
If the blood runs out,

03:15.790 --> 03:18.150
the power of the Divine Hand will disappear too.

03:18.550 --> 03:20.990
So to remove the Divine Left Hand,

03:20.990 --> 03:22.030
all we must do is drain

03:22.030 --> 03:22.950
all his blood?

03:24.190 --> 03:25.390
It's easy to take the hand,

03:25.829 --> 03:27.190
but where can we find

03:27.190 --> 03:28.550
a new host?

03:30.220 --> 03:31.950
It's not like we haven't tried before.

03:50.230 --> 03:51.310
How are you?

03:51.910 --> 03:52.900
A bit cold.

04:08.550 --> 04:09.790
Are you feeling any better?

04:14.580 --> 04:16.149
They are torturing you.

04:17.660 --> 04:19.060
It's spirit refinement.

04:19.310 --> 04:20.790
The spirit refinement is fake.

04:21.589 --> 04:22.550
You don't understand.

04:47.600 --> 04:48.390
He's back!

04:54.470 --> 04:55.500
He's not doing well.

04:56.490 --> 04:57.380
Leave him to me.

05:05.630 --> 05:07.270
Tanyin, Tanyin.

05:07.670 --> 05:08.950
Return to the Divine Realm quickly to meet me.

05:24.240 --> 05:25.270
Why have you summoned me?

05:25.270 --> 05:26.780
The Five Direction Deities of

05:26.950 --> 05:28.910
Thunder Division's Discipline Hall have summoned you.

05:28.990 --> 05:30.990
The Thunder Division's Discipline Deities

05:30.990 --> 05:33.600
govern the rules and laws of heaven and earth.

05:33.870 --> 05:35.230
It's your first time meeting them.

05:35.230 --> 05:36.240
Don't be disrespectful.

05:36.240 --> 05:37.560
Answer appropriately.

05:37.560 --> 05:38.590
No matter what

05:38.590 --> 05:39.870
demands they make,

05:39.870 --> 05:41.500
it's better to agree first.

05:41.500 --> 05:42.110
Later,

05:42.110 --> 05:43.870
we'll figure out a solution together.

06:02.490 --> 06:05.110
[Discipline Hall of the Divine Realm]

06:21.990 --> 06:22.790
Tanyin,

06:23.110 --> 06:24.670
hurry and pay your respects to the Five Deities.

06:28.790 --> 06:30.990
I, Ji Tanyin, God of Craft, Goddess Wushuang,

06:31.030 --> 06:33.180
pay my respects to the Five Lords of the Discipline Hall.

06:33.670 --> 06:34.830
Goddess Wushuang,

06:35.510 --> 06:36.310
please rise.

06:37.590 --> 06:38.550
Thank you, my Lord.

06:42.110 --> 06:43.500
You went to the mortal realm to search for Taihe's

06:43.500 --> 06:45.030
lost left hand.

06:45.420 --> 06:46.590
It's been a long time.

06:46.130 --> 06:47.590
[Divine Race, Deity Zhifa]

06:46.890 --> 06:47.980
Have you made any progress?

06:48.270 --> 06:49.990
Yes, my lord, I have.

06:50.310 --> 06:51.390
Report quickly.

06:51.790 --> 06:52.870
It has been confirmed

06:52.990 --> 06:54.710
that the Divine Left Hand is on Fangwai Mountain,

06:54.710 --> 06:57.070
in the possession of Yuanzhong, the High Priest of the Youhu Clan.

06:57.630 --> 06:58.590
Sixty years ago,

06:58.590 --> 07:00.590
the Youhu Clan and the War Demons went to war.

07:00.870 --> 07:02.430
Dingxu, the Grand Elder of the Youhu Clan,

07:02.430 --> 07:04.230
accidentally found the Divine Left Hand.

07:04.280 --> 07:06.550
He then ordered the young members of the clan to try

07:05.840 --> 07:07.710
[Divine Race, Deity Subao]

07:06.590 --> 07:07.790
to control the divine artifact one by one.

07:07.830 --> 07:09.150
Yuanzhong, with his exceptional talent,

07:09.000 --> 07:10.640
[Divine Race, Deity Cheng'e, Deity Jicha]

07:09.150 --> 07:10.710
gained the approval of the Divine Left Hand

07:10.710 --> 07:12.350
and became its new host.

07:11.760 --> 07:13.290
[Divine Race, Deity Shangshan]

07:12.760 --> 07:13.460
Afterwards,

07:13.510 --> 07:15.390
the Youhu Clan used the power of the Divine Hand

07:15.390 --> 07:17.910
to defeat the War Demons at Pinghu Xianzhou.

07:17.950 --> 07:20.950
So, how powerful are the magical powers of

07:20.990 --> 07:22.100
the Youhu Clan's High Priest?

07:22.500 --> 07:24.070
The Divine Left Hand was created by me

07:24.070 --> 07:25.990
using Deity Taihe's left hand as a base

07:26.270 --> 07:28.390
and refined with heavenly treasures.

07:28.680 --> 07:30.390
It's an unparalleled divine artifact in the Six Realms.

07:30.390 --> 07:32.310
Yuanzhong is a mortal being,

07:32.340 --> 07:34.070
but as the new host,

07:34.070 --> 07:36.110
his magical powers are not to be underestimated.

07:37.230 --> 07:38.390
How does he compare to you?

07:40.150 --> 07:41.230
Though the Divine Hand is powerful,

07:41.230 --> 07:42.430
I am, after all,

07:42.430 --> 07:43.620
the creator of this divine artifact.

07:43.620 --> 07:45.030
I have my ways to deal with it.

07:45.230 --> 07:46.750
Then why haven't you

07:46.750 --> 07:48.670
brought the Divine Left Hand back to the Divine Realm yet?

07:51.590 --> 07:52.390
Because

07:53.300 --> 07:54.390
I cannot.

08:00.110 --> 08:01.150
Please forgive us, my lord.

08:01.390 --> 08:03.150
Since her ascension, Goddess Wushuang

08:03.150 --> 08:05.150
has been diligently focused on creation.

08:05.230 --> 08:06.390
During the war between gods and demons,

08:06.390 --> 08:07.900
most of the magical artifacts used by the deities

08:07.900 --> 08:09.550
were crafted by Wushuang.

08:09.630 --> 08:10.520
After the great war,

08:10.550 --> 08:12.780
the celestial ladder collapsed and Taihe fell into slumber.

08:12.910 --> 08:14.070
It was Goddess Wushuang who

08:14.070 --> 08:15.670
voluntarily jumped from the Ascension Platform,

08:15.750 --> 08:16.830
passed through the Sea of Flux,

08:16.830 --> 08:18.110
endured the torture of thousand of cuts,

08:18.110 --> 08:19.550
before finally descending to the mortal realm.

08:19.630 --> 08:20.790
She is humble

08:20.790 --> 08:21.910
and straightforward in nature.

08:22.230 --> 08:23.800
I hope you can be lenient

08:23.950 --> 08:25.020
and allow her to explain herself.

08:26.230 --> 08:28.710
My lord, the reason why I

08:28.710 --> 08:29.990
haven't taken action yet

08:30.110 --> 08:31.390
is because over the past 60 years,

08:31.390 --> 08:32.429
Yuanzhong and the Divine Hand

08:32.429 --> 08:33.669
have been connected

08:33.669 --> 08:34.750
as one.

08:34.750 --> 08:35.950
If we were to take the hand now,

08:35.950 --> 08:37.789
it would certainly cost him his life.

08:38.110 --> 08:39.590
I attained godhood

08:39.590 --> 08:40.990
and receive mortal worship.

08:41.080 --> 08:42.140
If I were to kill the innocent,

08:42.140 --> 08:43.230
it would violate the laws of heaven.

08:43.460 --> 08:46.390
Therefore, I'm afraid I cannot comply with the order.

08:46.910 --> 08:48.150
Only those who are blameless and guiltless

08:48.180 --> 08:49.440
can be considered innocent.

08:49.630 --> 08:51.550
But that High Priest of the Youhu Clan

08:51.620 --> 08:52.830
is guilty of the Five Evils

08:52.900 --> 08:54.110
and has committed the Five Sins.

08:55.190 --> 08:56.510
How can he be innocent?

08:57.230 --> 08:58.350
My lord, may I ask

08:58.590 --> 09:01.150
what are the Five Evils and the Five Sins

09:01.150 --> 09:02.470
that Yuanzhong is guilty of?

09:02.620 --> 09:03.430
Tanyin.

09:03.460 --> 09:06.420
Usurping a divine artifact is the sin of theft,

09:06.790 --> 09:07.710
an evil act.

09:07.820 --> 09:09.140
My lord, there's something you don't know.

09:09.580 --> 09:11.830
Yuanzhong did not usurp the Divine Hand willingly.

09:11.910 --> 09:12.990
It was the clan's Elders

09:12.990 --> 09:14.300
who, using the survival of the clan,

09:14.300 --> 09:15.400
pressured him with a greater cause.

09:15.400 --> 09:17.070
Yuanzhong had no choice

09:17.230 --> 09:19.070
but to attempt to inherit the Divine Hand

09:19.070 --> 09:20.230
to protect his people.

09:20.510 --> 09:21.830
After the war between gods and demons,

09:21.870 --> 09:23.000
the celestial ladder was destroyed.

09:23.350 --> 09:24.550
The mortal beings

09:24.630 --> 09:26.550
have long lost contact with the Divine Realm.

09:26.830 --> 09:27.790
To them, the Divine Hand

09:27.790 --> 09:28.670
descending from the heavens

09:28.670 --> 09:29.750
was a gift from the heavens,

09:29.750 --> 09:31.030
an object without an owner.

09:31.070 --> 09:32.150
My lord,

09:32.430 --> 09:33.710
is using an ownerless object

09:33.950 --> 09:35.430
to protect one's kin

09:35.430 --> 09:36.580
a sin?

09:36.950 --> 09:39.750
Self-proclaiming godhood is the sin of fraud,

09:39.910 --> 09:40.710
an evil title.

09:40.790 --> 09:42.470
Yuanzhong never proclaimed himself a god.

09:42.470 --> 09:44.350
It was members of the Youhu Clan who used his name

09:44.350 --> 09:45.470
to commit unkind acts

09:45.470 --> 09:46.710
and gather ill-gotten gains,

09:46.710 --> 09:47.620
borrowing the tiger's might.

09:47.620 --> 09:48.790
It has nothing to do with him.

09:48.960 --> 09:51.710
Bringing calamity to the world is the sin of lawlessness,

09:51.750 --> 09:52.550
an evil intent.

09:52.710 --> 09:55.670
Poisoning the masses is the sin of harm,

09:55.710 --> 09:56.510
an evil heart.

09:57.110 --> 09:59.030
After the Battle of Pinghu,

09:59.230 --> 10:00.510
Yuanzhong was feared by his own people.

10:00.710 --> 10:02.030
His magical powers were sealed

10:02.110 --> 10:04.190
and he was imprisoned for over 40 years.

10:04.310 --> 10:05.270
Even now,

10:05.270 --> 10:06.980
he still wears shackles all day,

10:06.980 --> 10:08.150
enduring great suffering.

10:08.270 --> 10:09.950
He can't even leave Fangwai Mountain.

10:09.950 --> 10:11.430
How can he possibly bring calamity to the world

10:11.430 --> 10:12.580
or poison the masses?

10:13.070 --> 10:14.550
Even if it was his clansmen

10:14.550 --> 10:17.190
who borrowed his reputation to intimidate others,

10:17.390 --> 10:18.470
he didn't stop them.

10:19.070 --> 10:22.080
The evil consequences committed in his name

10:22.470 --> 10:23.630
are also his crimes.

10:24.630 --> 10:26.230
He is already a prisoner.

10:26.350 --> 10:27.590
How can he possibly stop others

10:27.590 --> 10:28.470
from committing evil?

10:30.790 --> 10:31.910
By that logic,

10:32.390 --> 10:34.670
Deity Taihe is the Primordial God,

10:34.790 --> 10:36.600
yet he couldn't prevent the demon race

10:36.630 --> 10:37.630
from acting perversely

10:37.630 --> 10:38.830
and causing chaos in the Six Realms.

10:38.870 --> 10:41.030
Wouldn't that make Deity Taihe a sinner as well?

10:41.030 --> 10:41.910
How dare you!

10:44.270 --> 10:45.310
My lord, please calm your anger.

10:51.980 --> 10:54.110
What a sharp tongue.

10:55.820 --> 10:57.470
The Thunder Division manages the precepts of the Six Realms,

10:57.750 --> 10:58.720
rewarding good and punishing evil,

10:58.720 --> 10:59.870
deciding life and death.

10:59.870 --> 11:02.190
It is the most righteous place in heaven and earth.

11:03.310 --> 11:05.470
I dare not seek advantage through words.

11:06.110 --> 11:07.550
I'm merely speaking the truth

11:07.750 --> 11:08.910
with a clear conscience.

11:11.270 --> 11:13.310
Well said, "speaking the truth

11:13.310 --> 11:14.630
with a clear conscience."

11:14.920 --> 11:16.120
Let me ask you this.

11:16.150 --> 11:18.870
In the Battle of Pinghu,

11:19.030 --> 11:21.140
Yuanzhong slaughtered countless War Demons.

11:21.470 --> 11:23.830
He committed numerous acts of killing.

11:24.750 --> 11:27.630
Is this not the sin of cruelty?

11:27.740 --> 11:29.110
Is he not vicious?

11:29.310 --> 11:30.400
In a war between two races,

11:30.400 --> 11:31.550
it's a matter of life and death.

11:31.550 --> 11:33.140
He did it to protect his people.

11:33.270 --> 11:35.390
Are the lives of the Youhu Clan members the only ones that matter?

11:35.430 --> 11:37.590
Don't the lives of the War Demons count?

11:37.910 --> 11:39.550
Have you truly tried to understand

11:39.550 --> 11:41.470
why the two clans went to war?

11:41.550 --> 11:43.470
Is it all the War Demons' fault?

11:43.470 --> 11:44.550
Are you sure

11:44.710 --> 11:46.670
that all the souls who died by his blade

11:47.240 --> 11:48.950
deserved to die?

11:49.630 --> 11:51.230
You already have a bias.

11:51.590 --> 11:53.430
How can you fairly judge

11:53.430 --> 11:55.070
good and evil?

11:55.790 --> 11:56.670
Perhaps

11:56.870 --> 11:58.110
I do have a bias.

11:58.630 --> 12:00.270
But may I ask my lords,

12:00.510 --> 12:01.470
aren't you all

12:01.470 --> 12:02.430
biased as well?

12:04.590 --> 12:06.140
Tanyin, stop talking.

12:07.490 --> 12:09.250
The Divine Realm needs Deity Taihe.

12:09.590 --> 12:11.860
Deity Taihe needs the Divine Left Hand.

12:11.880 --> 12:14.090
The Divine Left Hand will take Yuanzhong's life.

12:15.260 --> 12:16.540
Perhaps his existence

12:17.510 --> 12:18.910
is a sin.

12:19.900 --> 12:20.770
But I can't accept that.

12:21.280 --> 12:22.480
When I was a student, I heard

12:22.510 --> 12:23.670
a saying that goes,

12:24.030 --> 12:25.200
"Humans are neither good nor evil.

12:25.260 --> 12:27.070
Goodness and evil reside in one's heart."

12:28.790 --> 12:29.660
It means that,

12:29.660 --> 12:30.870
from different perspectives,

12:30.870 --> 12:33.030
the perception of good and evil varies.

12:33.540 --> 12:34.470
You have

12:34.470 --> 12:35.990
a reason to kill him.

12:36.030 --> 12:37.870
I also have a reason to save him.

12:38.030 --> 12:39.390
If I'm wrong,

12:39.720 --> 12:41.900
I'm willing to bear all the consequences.

12:42.030 --> 12:43.660
Tanyin, don't talk nonsense.

12:44.470 --> 12:45.470
My lords,

12:45.510 --> 12:46.630
she's speaking recklessly.

12:46.630 --> 12:47.660
Please be lenient.

12:48.540 --> 12:49.350
Very well.

12:51.940 --> 12:53.310
This is the Prison of Restraint.

12:53.510 --> 12:55.390
Everyone has one

12:55.470 --> 12:57.710
created by the desires in one's heart.

12:57.980 --> 13:00.910
For the virtuous, it's like spring waters in March,

13:00.960 --> 13:02.470
blooming with flowers.

13:03.140 --> 13:06.430
For the wicked, it's like the Nine Hells,

13:06.630 --> 13:07.910
with raging flames

13:07.910 --> 13:09.270
and evil spirits,

13:09.270 --> 13:10.590
never seeing daylight,

13:10.590 --> 13:12.150
never to be reborn.

13:12.470 --> 13:13.430
This one

13:13.870 --> 13:16.150
belongs to that High Priest.

13:16.590 --> 13:18.830
You firmly believe he's good, don't you?

13:19.030 --> 13:22.310
Then go in and see for yourself.

13:25.600 --> 13:26.670
Thank you, my lord.

13:26.870 --> 13:27.990
I'm willing to go.

14:27.030 --> 14:27.950
You're awake?

14:29.460 --> 14:30.660
How long have I been asleep?

14:30.830 --> 14:31.870
Two days and two nights.

14:33.510 --> 14:34.430
Nothing happened?

14:34.450 --> 14:34.940
Nothing.

14:34.970 --> 14:36.650
If anything had happened, I would have woken you up.

14:38.270 --> 14:40.070
Baili Xiang, following Dingxu's orders,

14:40.070 --> 14:40.870
investigated the War Division.

14:40.870 --> 14:42.070
It made quite a commotion.

14:42.190 --> 14:43.550
But everyone in the War Division is loyal to Tanghua.

14:43.550 --> 14:44.470
They're united as one.

14:44.690 --> 14:46.260
Moreover, the matter of the possessing

14:46.280 --> 14:47.280
is unknown to others.

14:47.990 --> 14:49.710
His efforts were ultimately in vain.

14:50.350 --> 14:52.150
The news of the War Demons' return

14:52.190 --> 14:53.630
has quietly spread within the clan.

14:54.430 --> 14:56.270
Many have come back.

14:56.790 --> 14:58.270
Tianqu Peak has been bustling these days.

14:58.270 --> 14:59.350
Many people have been seeking Dingxu

14:59.350 --> 15:00.310
for information.

15:01.830 --> 15:02.790
What about Tanghua?

15:03.670 --> 15:06.030
The day you came down from Tianqu Peak,

15:06.670 --> 15:08.150
he beat Sheng Xiang.

15:08.780 --> 15:10.590
The exact reason is unclear,

15:10.630 --> 15:12.760
but they say Sheng Xiang offended him.

15:14.310 --> 15:15.310
Was it a severe beating?

15:15.670 --> 15:16.470
I don't know.

15:20.990 --> 15:22.310
Are you going to see him?

15:22.730 --> 15:24.170
You're still very weak right now.

15:24.190 --> 15:25.510
You need time to recover.

15:39.470 --> 15:40.430
Where's Ji Tanyin?

15:40.910 --> 15:41.620
I don't know.

15:41.620 --> 15:42.940
She hasn't left her room for two days.

15:44.230 --> 15:45.470
What's she doing inside?

15:45.860 --> 15:46.950
Sleeping, I guess.

15:47.110 --> 15:48.670
Do you need her? I can call her.

16:12.380 --> 16:13.670
Goddess Wushuang,

16:22.670 --> 16:23.840
a moment in this world

16:24.190 --> 16:25.430
is a year in the Prison of Restraint.

16:25.910 --> 16:27.110
After all this time,

16:27.360 --> 16:28.790
have you come to your senses?

16:32.180 --> 16:33.790
You're still stubborn and unrepentant.

16:34.510 --> 16:35.910
It's not that I'm being stubborn,

16:35.910 --> 16:37.790
but Yuanzhong is inherently kind-hearted.

16:37.790 --> 16:38.830
He was persecuted;

16:38.830 --> 16:39.950
his crime does not warrant death.

16:40.150 --> 16:41.470
So what do you propose?

16:41.790 --> 16:43.790
The creation of all things is different,

16:44.230 --> 16:45.670
just like the Prison of Restraint.

16:45.960 --> 16:47.630
Outside, only day and night change,

16:47.750 --> 16:50.030
but within, the world has long been reshaped.

16:50.470 --> 16:52.230
Deity Taihe has ruled the heavens

16:52.230 --> 16:53.620
for hundreds of thousands of years,

16:53.910 --> 16:54.880
while Yuanzhong's lifespan

16:54.910 --> 16:56.110
is fleeting.

16:56.790 --> 16:57.700
To the gods,

16:57.740 --> 16:59.420
it is merely the blink of an eye.

17:00.230 --> 17:01.550
I humbly beseech the esteemed divine lords

17:01.550 --> 17:02.430
to show mercy

17:02.430 --> 17:03.910
and allow him to live out the rest of his days.

17:04.150 --> 17:05.740
I'm willing to stay by his side.

17:05.869 --> 17:07.589
When his life comes to an end,

17:07.589 --> 17:10.230
I'll bring the Divine Left Hand to the Divine Realm.

17:31.350 --> 17:33.510
Virtue is rewarded, and the heavens are not without compassion.

17:33.550 --> 17:34.990
I hope you can show mercy.

17:37.390 --> 17:39.910
You've seen the Prison of Restraint within his heart.

17:40.590 --> 17:41.910
You should know

17:42.020 --> 17:43.780
what it's like inside.

17:44.460 --> 17:46.710
Do you still want to believe in him?

17:47.030 --> 17:47.830
Yes, I do.

17:48.270 --> 17:49.110
Why?

17:56.670 --> 17:57.470
Forget it.

17:58.110 --> 18:00.950
Now that the gods slumber alongside Taihe,

18:01.230 --> 18:02.670
the divine race has declined,

18:03.230 --> 18:04.630
and the celestial ladder has collapsed.

18:04.870 --> 18:07.750
You're the only one remaining in the mortal world.

18:08.050 --> 18:09.290
If you insist,

18:10.310 --> 18:12.110
we have no choice but to relent.

18:14.200 --> 18:15.310
Thank you, My Lord.

18:15.310 --> 18:18.160
Don't thank me yet. I have three conditions.

18:18.230 --> 18:21.110
You must agree to them before I grant my permission.

18:21.680 --> 18:22.740
My Lord, please speak.

18:22.870 --> 18:23.670
First,

18:23.950 --> 18:25.270
you must not reveal

18:25.270 --> 18:26.870
your identity to anyone,

18:26.960 --> 18:30.020
nor disclose anything about the Divine Realm.

18:30.310 --> 18:31.110
Yes.

18:31.110 --> 18:31.870
Second,

18:32.870 --> 18:35.190
you must remain by his side at all times.

18:35.740 --> 18:37.750
The Divine Left Hand must not

18:37.910 --> 18:39.670
fall into the hands of others,

18:39.990 --> 18:41.270
nor may he

18:41.430 --> 18:43.430
use it for evil.

18:43.550 --> 18:44.350
Yes.

18:44.910 --> 18:45.710
Third,

18:46.550 --> 18:49.190
you must not develop feelings for him.

18:49.740 --> 18:51.390
You must never let emotions

18:51.630 --> 18:53.430
cloud your judgment.

18:53.670 --> 18:54.460
Yes.

18:54.710 --> 18:56.110
I will certainly comply.

19:13.150 --> 19:14.550
Since the Demon War,

19:14.750 --> 19:16.340
the gods have slumbered,

19:16.870 --> 19:20.070
leaving only us to uphold the balance of heaven and earth.

19:20.470 --> 19:23.400
There is no room for the slightest deviation.

19:23.630 --> 19:25.630
Since you have sworn by the spiritual heart,

19:25.670 --> 19:27.430
you must honor your vow.

19:27.830 --> 19:29.100
If you break it,

19:29.510 --> 19:31.110
your soul will be shattered,

19:31.630 --> 19:33.390
and your divine soul will be obliterated.

19:34.300 --> 19:35.590
I remember that.

19:35.630 --> 19:36.910
Goddess Wushuang,

19:37.310 --> 19:39.390
you are a prodigy.

19:39.990 --> 19:43.300
At such a young age, you ascended with your craftsmanship.

19:43.550 --> 19:45.710
Though you've lived for a thousand years,

19:45.790 --> 19:47.990
your heart remains pure.

19:48.710 --> 19:49.950
Sometimes, right and wrong, good and evil,

19:50.030 --> 19:52.870
are not things you can tell

19:53.630 --> 19:55.150
with just your eyes.

19:55.470 --> 19:56.870
I hope that in the future,

19:57.460 --> 20:00.670
you won't regret the choice you make today.

20:01.270 --> 20:02.750
Thank you for your concern, My Lord.

20:04.630 --> 20:06.110
I chose this path myself,

20:06.230 --> 20:07.470
and I will never regret it.

20:16.870 --> 20:18.910
You're really too bold.

20:18.910 --> 20:21.070
You actually dared to confront

20:21.070 --> 20:21.910
those old gods.

20:21.910 --> 20:23.430
They didn't even care about

20:23.430 --> 20:24.190
Taihe's face.

20:24.190 --> 20:25.710
A quarter inside is a year outside.

20:25.710 --> 20:26.750
So, does that mean you've been stuck in there

20:26.750 --> 20:27.750
for two hundred years?

20:28.360 --> 20:29.830
Was it really that long?

20:30.390 --> 20:31.700
I didn't even notice.

20:31.700 --> 20:32.720
You're so absentminded,

20:32.720 --> 20:33.950
how could you possibly notice?

20:34.550 --> 20:35.980
Hannv, I don't mean to blame you,

20:35.980 --> 20:37.150
but since you were inside,

20:37.150 --> 20:38.590
why didn't you try to persuade her?

20:38.590 --> 20:39.390
Hannv has always been

20:39.390 --> 20:40.590
speaking up for me.

20:44.630 --> 20:46.470
Hannv, what's wrong?

20:47.510 --> 20:48.540
Hannv,

20:48.590 --> 20:50.710
are you blaming me, or...

20:50.710 --> 20:51.550
You've already explained

20:51.550 --> 20:53.150
everything clearly inside.

20:53.190 --> 20:54.550
You have your own thoughts,

20:54.550 --> 20:55.750
I won't force you.

20:56.020 --> 20:57.030
But Tanyin,

20:57.340 --> 20:58.310
as a god,

20:58.310 --> 20:59.390
you mustn't misuse your divine power in the mortal realm.

20:59.390 --> 21:01.150
Otherwise, you'll suffer backlash.

21:01.510 --> 21:02.590
You are the God of Craftsmanship,

21:02.590 --> 21:03.670
and your physical body is not strong.

21:04.150 --> 21:05.950
With only your craft and martial skills,

21:05.950 --> 21:07.950
you do have opponents in the mortal realm.

21:08.270 --> 21:09.590
If you continue to push too hard,

21:09.680 --> 21:10.950
be careful not to bring harm to yourself.

21:11.630 --> 21:12.710
I've said all I need to.

21:12.730 --> 21:13.730
I'll take my leave now.

21:14.030 --> 21:15.920
Mr. Loong, please escort Tanyin to the mortal realm.

21:22.030 --> 21:23.590
Is she angry with me?

21:25.030 --> 21:26.550
Taihe is more important to her

21:26.550 --> 21:28.150
than her own life.

21:28.310 --> 21:29.380
Of course, she hopes

21:29.400 --> 21:30.790
he wakes up soon.

21:34.590 --> 21:35.390
Tanyin,

21:35.740 --> 21:37.500
there's something I want to ask you.

21:38.310 --> 21:39.110
Please go ahead.

21:39.230 --> 21:41.830
You firmly protected the High Priest of the Youhu Clan,

21:42.040 --> 21:43.240
swearing an oath with the spiritual heart

21:43.260 --> 21:44.540
and risking your life—

21:44.630 --> 21:45.990
was it really just because

21:45.990 --> 21:47.100
he's a good person?

23:00.590 --> 23:01.390
By the way,

23:01.800 --> 23:03.120
when you passed by Baisha Bay

23:03.310 --> 23:04.390
on your way to Fangwai Mountain,

23:04.960 --> 23:06.480
did you try the pricky fruit there?

23:07.190 --> 23:08.230
What's a pricky fruit?

23:08.750 --> 23:10.070
It's a small black fruit,

23:10.460 --> 23:11.780
about the size of a fingernail.

23:12.310 --> 23:13.350
It's sour at first

23:13.500 --> 23:14.470
but has a sweet aftertaste.

23:14.920 --> 23:15.880
It's quite delicious.

23:59.870 --> 24:00.830
How did you sleep?

24:01.710 --> 24:02.510
Not bad.

24:03.500 --> 24:04.910
I ran all night in my dreams.

24:07.900 --> 24:09.420
Were you still being chased by a group of people

24:09.800 --> 24:12.080
while covered in shackles?

24:12.880 --> 24:13.910
It was different this time.

24:14.760 --> 24:15.710
I dreamt about

24:15.870 --> 24:17.390
the clan's grand exam from when I was a child.

24:19.020 --> 24:20.590
If I remember correctly,

24:20.950 --> 24:22.030
this is the first time

24:22.030 --> 24:23.070
you've dreamt about your childhood.

24:24.430 --> 24:25.640
What was on the exam?

24:28.910 --> 24:30.020
I don't remember clearly.

24:30.630 --> 24:33.150
I only recall that the questions were very difficult,

24:34.110 --> 24:35.180
I couldn't answer them,

24:35.870 --> 24:36.990
and time was running out.

24:37.470 --> 24:38.670
The people taking the exam with me

24:38.670 --> 24:40.030
started leaving one by one.

24:40.580 --> 24:42.380
Who was there

24:42.380 --> 24:44.100
taking the exam with you?

24:45.990 --> 24:46.850
Tanghua

24:48.110 --> 24:48.910
and...

24:52.390 --> 24:54.630
Their faces are all blurry.

24:56.600 --> 24:57.480
Did Tanghua

24:58.070 --> 24:59.940
take the exam with you?

25:02.630 --> 25:03.750
I couldn't answer the questions,

25:04.750 --> 25:06.470
so I wanted to copy from his paper.

25:07.680 --> 25:08.800
But that guy

25:08.830 --> 25:10.110
covered it tightly.

25:10.640 --> 25:11.590
He finished and just left

25:12.190 --> 25:13.510
without even looking at me.

25:14.510 --> 25:15.870
Are you worried about him?

25:17.490 --> 25:19.410
I could barely take care of myself,

25:20.030 --> 25:21.670
why would I worry about him?

25:22.740 --> 25:23.540
I mean,

25:24.470 --> 25:26.590
Xiazhi and Chiyi

25:26.590 --> 25:27.670
have been continuously murdered recently.

25:28.370 --> 25:30.280
Baili Xiang has taken over the War Division

25:30.410 --> 25:31.810
and is conducting thorough investigations.

25:32.350 --> 25:34.350
Even Jiuguang has been detained.

25:35.060 --> 25:36.790
Tanghua has never

25:36.790 --> 25:37.920
been wronged like this.

25:38.800 --> 25:41.240
I heard that yesterday, he even

25:41.270 --> 25:42.750
hit Sheng Xiang.

25:44.150 --> 25:45.960
Tanghua used to be

25:45.960 --> 25:47.230
so gentle.

25:47.750 --> 25:49.430
But ever since you went into seclusion,

25:50.150 --> 25:51.150
he's changed quite a bit.

25:55.200 --> 25:56.700
Who hasn't changed?

25:58.310 --> 25:59.110
By the way,

25:59.520 --> 26:01.840
I also dreamt of the Ascension Platform in the Divine Realm.

26:02.470 --> 26:03.630
It's made of

26:04.230 --> 26:05.270
glazed tiles,

26:06.030 --> 26:07.470
and looked so dazzling.

26:09.620 --> 26:10.900
Standing in front of it,

26:11.350 --> 26:13.550
I felt like a tiny ant.

26:14.730 --> 26:16.140
No matter how hard I tried,

26:16.660 --> 26:18.030
I couldn't open that door.

26:18.990 --> 26:20.750
I have a strong premonition that

26:20.870 --> 26:22.590
if I can just step through that door,

26:23.030 --> 26:24.470
I'll ascend to a god.

26:26.510 --> 26:29.940
Maybe it was just a dream.

26:30.750 --> 26:32.350
You don't need to take it too seriously.

26:33.500 --> 26:34.500
I don't think so.

26:34.950 --> 26:36.470
Spirit refinement is especially useful for me.

26:37.350 --> 26:39.150
Every time I return from Tianqu Peak,

26:39.470 --> 26:40.950
I have similar dreams.

26:41.550 --> 26:42.710
The fact that

26:43.110 --> 26:44.190
I can see the Ascension Platform

26:44.190 --> 26:45.070
but can't enter it

26:45.390 --> 26:46.750
is probably because

26:47.240 --> 26:48.540
my cultivation isn't sufficient yet.

26:52.990 --> 26:53.910
Elder Xinyao,

26:54.030 --> 26:55.030
the medicine is ready.

26:55.160 --> 26:55.950
Please put it here.

26:59.070 --> 27:00.950
Remember to take it on time.

27:01.950 --> 27:02.750
Don't worry.

27:04.270 --> 27:05.670
Then I'll take my leave.

27:06.310 --> 27:07.510
Take care, Elder Xinyao.

27:29.110 --> 27:30.190
Elder Xinyao left

27:30.190 --> 27:31.390
with a cold expression.

27:31.390 --> 27:32.680
She didn't seem to be in a good mood.

27:34.350 --> 27:35.390
She prides herself on being a good person,

27:35.390 --> 27:36.910
but she's been forced to do bad things,

27:37.060 --> 27:37.870
so her conscience

27:37.900 --> 27:39.420
is constantly in turmoil.

27:39.740 --> 27:41.270
How could she possibly feel at ease?

27:41.950 --> 27:42.750
So,

27:43.100 --> 27:44.510
it's easier to be a villain.

27:44.670 --> 27:46.110
At least you don't have the burden on your conscience.

27:46.390 --> 27:48.390
So you're happy now?

27:50.540 --> 27:51.330
Not really.

27:55.710 --> 27:57.550
What about Tanghua? Has he been released?

27:58.950 --> 28:00.640
You asked about that yourself yesterday.

28:00.670 --> 28:01.430
Baili Xiang naturally

28:01.430 --> 28:02.550
has to give you face.

28:02.630 --> 28:04.310
He's already back at the Jinxia Palace.

28:05.710 --> 28:07.310
Tanghua was also pushed to the edge.

28:07.670 --> 28:08.950
He's been this way since he was young,

28:09.020 --> 28:10.100
unable to take a different approach.

28:11.430 --> 28:12.270
What about Sheng Xiang?

28:12.670 --> 28:13.470
Is she dead?

28:13.950 --> 28:15.430
Elder Dingxu personally intervened,

28:15.430 --> 28:16.620
so how could he let him die?

28:17.020 --> 28:17.820
Besides,

28:17.910 --> 28:19.470
Tanghua wasn't that ruthless.

28:20.010 --> 28:21.330
They're just using this

28:21.360 --> 28:22.410
to pressure the War Division.

28:22.830 --> 28:24.110
Baili Xiang has been conducting inspections in the War Division recently,

28:24.110 --> 28:25.350
causing quite a bit of trouble.

28:27.340 --> 28:28.550
If that's the case,

28:28.830 --> 28:30.340
if Tanghua didn't make a move,

28:30.640 --> 28:31.610
with that old woman around,

28:31.630 --> 28:32.830
we'd still have a chance.

28:34.700 --> 28:35.950
It wasn't in public,

28:36.340 --> 28:37.750
I still feel a bit risky.

28:41.570 --> 28:42.290
Where's Ji Tanyin?

28:42.300 --> 28:43.440
What's she been doing these past few days?

28:43.470 --> 28:44.550
Is she still sleeping in her room?

28:45.060 --> 28:46.070
I don't know either.

28:55.640 --> 28:56.430
Ji Tanyin,

28:57.560 --> 28:58.360
what are you doing?

28:58.390 --> 28:59.460
I'm cooking.

28:59.670 --> 29:00.480
Cooking?

29:01.180 --> 29:03.310
I want to make be an automaton that

29:03.350 --> 29:04.790
can both cook and clean.

29:04.990 --> 29:05.790
But,

29:06.070 --> 29:06.950
it seems like

29:06.950 --> 29:07.830
something went wrong,

29:08.400 --> 29:09.430
so it didn't succeed.

29:12.340 --> 29:13.630
You two stop standing here.

29:13.630 --> 29:14.830
Go wait for me over there.

29:14.830 --> 29:15.630
When it's ready,

29:15.630 --> 29:16.740
I'll bring it over to you.

29:17.550 --> 29:18.870
By the way, I've already informed

29:18.890 --> 29:19.890
Xiaoxiang Peak.

29:19.920 --> 29:20.440
From now on,

29:20.460 --> 29:21.980
they won't be delivering food to you.

29:22.070 --> 29:23.230
I'll be in charge of

29:23.270 --> 29:24.550
your meals from now on.

29:40.690 --> 29:41.500
What's this?

29:42.110 --> 29:43.110
Red Oil Cloud Strings.

29:43.870 --> 29:44.670
And this?

29:45.150 --> 29:46.310
Kidney Bean Immortal Soup.

29:48.510 --> 29:50.590
Then this must be

29:50.590 --> 29:51.590
the Grain Rain Tofu, right?

29:51.910 --> 29:53.860
Yes, you figured it out.

29:55.790 --> 29:56.870
You can't cook,

29:57.710 --> 29:59.190
and your housework is pretty sloppy.

29:59.260 --> 30:00.020
The flowers in the yard died

30:00.050 --> 30:01.330
after you watered them.

30:01.470 --> 30:02.150
I don't think

30:02.150 --> 30:03.500
I've made things hard for you.

30:04.840 --> 30:05.630
So,

30:05.830 --> 30:07.430
why would you overthink things?

30:07.550 --> 30:09.030
Why insist on cooking yourself

30:09.030 --> 30:09.910
and making it difficult for us,

30:09.910 --> 30:11.070
instead of letting Xiaoxiang Peak deliver the food?

30:11.710 --> 30:13.470
Because I want to be your handmaiden.

30:13.470 --> 30:14.310
But you already are

30:14.310 --> 30:15.110
my handmaiden.

30:15.110 --> 30:15.910
It's different.

30:16.230 --> 30:17.020
Before, I only planned

30:17.020 --> 30:18.470
to be your handmaiden for a while.

30:18.470 --> 30:19.190
But now I want

30:19.190 --> 30:20.230
to follow you for a lifetime.

30:20.230 --> 30:21.870
Naturally, I should do my duty well.

30:27.870 --> 30:29.550
Life is long. Don't casually

30:29.550 --> 30:30.710
talk about forever.

30:30.740 --> 30:31.710
I'm different.

30:31.830 --> 30:32.540
When I say something,

30:32.540 --> 30:33.700
I have to follow through.

30:33.700 --> 30:35.020
If I say I'll be with you for life,

30:35.020 --> 30:36.790
then I will.

30:36.870 --> 30:37.980
If you cook like this,

30:37.980 --> 30:38.670
forget about spending a lifetime.

30:38.670 --> 30:40.190
I can't even endure eating it for three days.

30:40.510 --> 30:41.310
But...

30:43.470 --> 30:45.400
Because cooking is really too difficult.

30:46.000 --> 30:47.880
The automaton can cut and cook,

30:47.940 --> 30:49.750
but it can't control the heat properly.

30:49.990 --> 30:50.790
So,

30:50.910 --> 30:52.470
to make a dish well,

30:52.510 --> 30:53.920
at least, I need a stove

30:53.920 --> 30:55.680
that can regulate the heat by itself.

30:55.910 --> 30:57.000
-And…
-Enough.

30:58.430 --> 30:59.830
There are many types of handmaidens.

30:59.990 --> 31:01.030
Some are good at cooking,

31:01.030 --> 31:02.020
some are good at cleaning,

31:02.020 --> 31:03.470
and some are good at singing and dancing.

31:03.580 --> 31:04.390
As for you,

31:10.950 --> 31:12.400
you have your own strengths.

31:12.400 --> 31:13.980
You don't need to compare yourself to others in everything.

31:15.110 --> 31:15.920
Really?

31:17.210 --> 31:18.810
I knew you're a good person.

31:18.830 --> 31:20.270
My judgment is never wrong.

31:20.300 --> 31:21.110
Good person?

31:21.310 --> 31:22.110
Yes.

31:32.710 --> 31:33.500
High Priest,

31:33.670 --> 31:35.030
since we're talking about this,

31:35.110 --> 31:37.070
let's set some rules.

31:38.020 --> 31:38.830
What rules?

31:38.830 --> 31:39.550
The rules for me being by your side

31:39.550 --> 31:40.710
for a lifetime.

31:41.070 --> 31:43.070
I've sworn to be with you

31:43.190 --> 31:44.640
until you

31:44.710 --> 31:45.700
reach the end of your days.

31:45.910 --> 31:46.670
I promise

31:46.670 --> 31:47.990
to accompany you, take care of you,

31:47.990 --> 31:49.190
and protect you

31:49.190 --> 31:49.830
for the rest of your life,

31:49.830 --> 31:50.710
never interfering with you

31:50.710 --> 31:52.540
or doing anything that might harm you.

31:52.590 --> 31:53.310
Likewise,

31:53.310 --> 31:54.830
you must promise me three things.

31:55.550 --> 31:56.350
First,

31:56.390 --> 31:57.630
you must not leave me.

31:57.630 --> 31:58.510
No matter where you go,

31:58.510 --> 31:59.550
I will follow you closely,

31:59.550 --> 32:00.150
never leaving your side.

32:00.150 --> 32:01.270
No matter what happens to you,

32:01.270 --> 32:02.630
and whatever you go through,

32:02.630 --> 32:03.870
even if the heavens change

32:03.870 --> 32:04.750
and the world collapses,

32:04.750 --> 32:05.950
we must stay together.

32:06.110 --> 32:06.910
Second,

32:06.950 --> 32:07.750
don't ask me too much

32:07.750 --> 32:08.820
about the past.

32:08.860 --> 32:09.790
I won't tell you

32:09.790 --> 32:10.830
everything.

32:11.020 --> 32:12.310
It's for your own good,

32:12.310 --> 32:13.240
because many things

32:13.240 --> 32:14.390
are decided by fate,

32:14.390 --> 32:15.310
and you can't change them,

32:15.310 --> 32:16.470
only accept them.

32:19.590 --> 32:20.360
Third...

32:23.230 --> 32:24.070
What's the third?

32:24.510 --> 32:25.310
Third...

32:26.670 --> 32:27.990
We probably won't reach that point.

32:28.430 --> 32:30.030
Just remember the first two steps.

32:32.790 --> 32:33.750
What are you laughing at?

32:35.420 --> 32:36.240
Nothing.

32:37.390 --> 32:38.190
Do you want to eat?

32:40.710 --> 32:41.590
I'm not very hungry.

32:41.870 --> 32:43.190
If you're not eating, go back and rest.

32:43.390 --> 32:44.510
Do you agree to it?

32:45.020 --> 32:46.110
Go back to sleep.

32:46.380 --> 32:47.180
A good night's sleep

32:47.210 --> 32:48.570
is the first step to welcoming good fortune.

32:49.000 --> 32:50.030
Then I'll go first.

32:50.510 --> 32:51.310
By the way,

32:51.310 --> 32:52.500
if you're really hungry,

32:52.590 --> 32:53.420
just eat a little.

32:53.420 --> 32:54.510
Although it doesn't look good,

32:54.510 --> 32:55.550
it's not poisonous.

32:55.580 --> 32:56.710
As long as it fills you up, it's fine.

32:56.790 --> 32:57.590
Go back.

32:58.110 --> 32:58.910
I'm leaving.

33:04.910 --> 33:06.670
I know what's wrong with her.

33:08.150 --> 33:08.950
What's wrong?

33:10.910 --> 33:11.710
Here.

33:21.070 --> 33:22.940
Now there's only one thing left.

34:20.889 --> 34:21.679
Guards!

34:25.110 --> 34:25.909
Grand Elder.

34:30.270 --> 34:31.070
With this,

34:31.510 --> 34:33.080
we can extend the City Lord's life.

34:36.310 --> 34:37.580
To avoid any unforeseen complications,

34:38.070 --> 34:40.190
I'll send someone to deliver the medicine right away.

34:40.429 --> 34:41.230
Okay.

34:41.590 --> 34:43.150
As for Lyu Yao you mentioned,

34:43.520 --> 34:45.080
I've already informed Yaoxiang Peak.

34:45.310 --> 34:47.830
I told them her elder passed away,

34:47.909 --> 34:49.429
and she needs to go back immediately.

34:50.389 --> 34:52.670
Elder Xinyao has agreed as well.

34:55.750 --> 34:57.510
This Essence Nourishing Pill is extremely precious.

34:57.950 --> 34:59.140
If it goes missing like this,

34:59.620 --> 35:01.220
even if it's not discovered right away,

35:01.800 --> 35:04.110
it will eventually be noticed.

35:05.630 --> 35:06.430
Young Mistress Dai,

35:07.040 --> 35:09.590
why don't you go with us?

35:13.590 --> 35:14.910
I still have some things to take care of.

35:15.470 --> 35:16.430
Forgive me for speaking out of turn,

35:18.270 --> 35:20.110
but Young Mistress Dai, your identity is extraordinary,

35:20.350 --> 35:21.430
your martial skills exceptional,

35:21.700 --> 35:23.750
and now you've regained your youth.

35:24.510 --> 35:26.910
Why do you lower yourself like this?

35:27.670 --> 35:29.790
Whether it's okay or not, it's fine;

35:29.820 --> 35:31.470
why can't you just ask him directly?

35:32.700 --> 35:34.270
Why waste time

35:34.830 --> 35:36.030
and let years slip by

35:36.980 --> 35:38.110
like this?

35:43.390 --> 35:44.870
The weather outside is nice today.

35:44.870 --> 35:45.550
Would you like to go out

35:45.550 --> 35:46.550
and soak up some sun?

35:46.710 --> 35:48.630
It's good for your health.

35:50.190 --> 35:51.110
I need to rest.

35:53.270 --> 35:54.070
Did you pick these?

35:56.190 --> 35:56.990
Yes, I did.

35:57.870 --> 35:58.990
You went to Baisha Bay?

36:00.550 --> 36:01.630
It seems you probably can't go too far

36:01.830 --> 36:03.230
with this.

36:06.190 --> 36:07.230
You mean this?

36:09.750 --> 36:10.790
I forgot that

36:10.830 --> 36:12.000
it doesn't work on you.

36:13.270 --> 36:14.160
Hurry up and eat.

36:14.200 --> 36:15.480
Don't you like it?

36:25.750 --> 36:27.110
These pricky fruits can't be eaten anymore.

36:28.030 --> 36:28.830
Why not?

36:30.950 --> 36:32.270
They're fresh.

36:33.130 --> 36:34.690
Pricky fruit is different from other fruits.

36:35.060 --> 36:36.660
If you don't eat it right away after picking it,

36:36.710 --> 36:37.910
the sweetness fades

36:38.030 --> 36:39.310
and it starts to have a faint bitterness.

36:39.620 --> 36:41.150
Especially if it's left overnight,

36:41.410 --> 36:42.930
it can even carry a slight toxicity.

36:45.350 --> 36:46.470
Don't wander around unnecessarily.

36:46.670 --> 36:47.830
it's better not to let others know,

36:47.870 --> 36:48.910
or it might cause trouble.

36:52.510 --> 36:53.310
You can go now.

36:53.480 --> 36:54.470
I need to rest.

37:01.850 --> 37:02.870
-What are you doing?
-Don't move.

37:06.030 --> 37:07.350
It just flashed.

37:07.430 --> 37:09.070
Is this some kind of immobilization array?

37:09.890 --> 37:11.430
It can track your location.

37:14.580 --> 37:15.390
Yuanzhong!

37:27.070 --> 37:27.870
Sorry to disturb you.

37:36.300 --> 37:36.990
This...

37:37.620 --> 37:38.780
This golden hoop is not an ordinary item.

37:39.420 --> 37:40.580
I'll go back and check some books.

37:51.950 --> 37:52.910
Forgive me for speaking out of turn,

37:53.750 --> 37:55.550
but Young Mistress Dai, your identity is extraordinary,

37:55.830 --> 37:56.910
your martial skills exceptional,

37:57.220 --> 37:59.270
and now you've regained your youth.

37:59.870 --> 38:02.390
Why do you lower yourself like this?

38:02.990 --> 38:05.030
Whether it's okay or not, it's fine;

38:05.110 --> 38:06.750
why can't you just ask him directly?

38:08.310 --> 38:09.110
Search for it!

38:09.390 --> 38:10.190
Yes!

38:17.230 --> 38:18.510
Greetings, Butler Shengxiang.

38:19.630 --> 38:20.910
May I ask what has happened?

38:20.990 --> 38:22.790
Something was lost at Tianqu Peak last night.

38:23.150 --> 38:25.910
The Grand Elder has ordered to search the entire clan.

38:34.670 --> 38:36.310
Do you really want to help him unlock

38:36.310 --> 38:37.470
that golden hoop?

38:39.270 --> 38:40.230
It is made of the immortal gold,

38:40.230 --> 38:41.270
which is incredibly heavy.

38:41.990 --> 38:43.990
Even though he has an immortal,

38:44.350 --> 38:45.350
wearing it all day

38:45.350 --> 38:46.470
is still torturous.

38:46.590 --> 38:47.870
Can you unlock it?

38:48.750 --> 38:49.670
I should be able to.

38:49.670 --> 38:51.590
If I can put it on, I should be able to unlock it for him.

38:52.590 --> 38:53.790
That makes sense.

39:30.620 --> 39:31.990
I just picked some cherries.

39:32.150 --> 39:33.190
Would you like to try some?

39:33.750 --> 39:34.550
Just leave them there.

39:45.670 --> 39:46.470
Do you need something?

39:47.790 --> 39:48.590
No,

39:49.140 --> 39:50.460
I see it's a bit messy here,

39:50.590 --> 39:51.830
so I'm helping you tidy up.

40:21.390 --> 40:22.420
Are you done cleaning?

40:24.910 --> 40:25.790
Not yet, just a little left.

40:25.950 --> 40:27.630
You interrupted me from copying the book.

40:31.310 --> 40:32.110
Get out.

40:36.030 --> 40:36.800
Get out.

41:39.110 --> 41:40.070
It seems this is

41:40.070 --> 41:41.190
the key to unlocking it.

42:33.350 --> 42:34.140
What are you doing?
